    "name": "native_probe_five_contracted_indices",
    "description": "Contractions over five indices at once: a rank-1 output folding a rank-5 state over all five of its axes plus the indices' own values, and a rank-0 observed folding the same state. The interpreter walks every tuple; native must fold the same terms in the same order, with a program whose length does not grow with the grid.",
